The file claim.py in this directory derives from src/claim.py of the CLAIM
replication package and has been modified. CLAIM recovers the services of a
repository from its Docker Compose files and Dockerfiles.

Upstream
    CLAIM_rep-pkg, the replication package of "CLAIM: a Lightweight Approach
    to Identify Microservices in Dockerized Environments".
    Maggi, Kevin (2024). CLAIM_rep-pkg. figshare.
    https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.25379212

